#
# Failing control for math:TensorPositiveRankAxisConstraint: a shape declares rank 2
# and no axis at all. The count law groups a shape by its axes, so a shape with none
# forms no group and that law stays silent; the index laws have no axis to read. The
# missing axis family is the only defect. Bound by ex:ecTensorPositiveRankNoAxis.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/tensor-shape-controls/> .

ex:shape a math:TensorShape ; math:tensorRank 2 .
